  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 21 * 4 * 156 * 13 * 11 = 83\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : −, ÷, ×, +\n\n21 - **4 ÷ 156**__ × 13 + 11 = 83\n\n21 - __**0.02 ×**____** 13**__ + 11 = 83\n\n__**21 + 11**__ - 0.26 = 83\n\n__**32 - 0.26**__ = 83\n\n&",
